# Copy to supabase/functions/.env (gitignored). Auto-loaded by `supabase start` /
# `supabase functions serve` for local Edge Functions — separate from the root .env
# (which only feeds supabase/config.toml's env(...) substitution, not function runtime
# env vars). Never set via `supabase secrets set` on hosted — this must only ever be a
# local file, so it can never be true in production by construction.

# Turns on diagnostic logging in supabase/functions/_shared/firebase.ts when Firebase ID
# token verification fails: logs the expected project id, the token's own (unverified)
# iss/aud claims, and the underlying jose error — never the token itself, the uid, or the
# phone number. Restart `supabase start` / `functions serve` after changing this file —
# env var changes aren't picked up by hot reload.
LOCAL_DEBUG_FIREBASE_AUTH=true
